SAFETY DISCLAIMER

This software is a research prototype for SCREENING purposes only. It is not a
certified measurement instrument.

Specifically, it does NOT provide certified tread depth in millimetres, and it
does NOT provide total axle toe, thrust angle, caster, or four-wheel alignment.
Alignment outputs are single-wheel screening estimates with uncertainty.

Tread depth and wheel alignment affect vehicle safety. Always verify with a
calibrated tread-depth gauge and a professional wheel-alignment machine before
making any decision about a vehicle's roadworthiness.
